			"notes": "## ⚙️ Features\n\n* Compact segmented warning marker near the crosshair\n* Tracks the nearest valid off-screen threat\n* Supports nearby hostiles, approaching hostiles, and off-screen players\n* Optional directional ping when the marker first appears\n* Detection radius configurable from `6` to `24` blocks, default `12`\n* Configurable marker radius and player filters\n* Survival-only mode\n* Mod Menu settings integration\n* Client-side only\n\n---\n\n## 🎮 Controls\n\n* `Open Attention Settings` keybind, unbound by default"
